      "text": "[9PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic flow from PWD Bolade Intersection inward National.\nFast-moving traffic from National to Ajayi Farm through Ikeja along, and from Ajayi Farm to Ile-Zik.\nSmooth traffic conditions from Ile-Zik connecting Sule Junction, and from Ile-Zik inward to Mangoro, Cement, and Iyana Dopemu underneath bridge.\nGood return journey with traffic moving as expected.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
