      "text": "[9:04PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from CMS Bridge inward Offin Canal Market stretch, down to Ijora Olopa, and NEPA Intersection.\nSteady movement on Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, connecting Offin Canal Market, Olowogbowo, and Offin Canal Market.\nGood traffic flow on Eko Bridge by NEPA Intersection inward to Apongbon.\nSmooth movement descending Eko Bridge inward CMS, Elegbeta Mini Stadium, and Ebute-Ero Market.\nGood traffic conditions from Ebute-Ero Market inward Leventis, through UBA Roundabout, connecting inner and outer Marina.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
