      "text": "[9:35PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Abule Ado through the underbridge, Volks, Afolabi Ege, to Iyana Iba.\nGood traffic flow from the intersection en route Igando, through First Gate, Iyana School, to Obadore Bridge, with a similarly smooth return journey.\nSmooth movement along Badagry Expressway, through Igbo Elerin Junction, Iyana Isashi, Iyana Era, to Custom Check Point.\nGood traffic conditions in and out of Igbo Elerin.\nGood connectivity on Afolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
